  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "아이고... 아파라.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n어머나, 물건을 찾아 주러 온 거니?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C774ACE0002E002E002E0020C544D30CB77C002E00100001BE01000AC5B4BA38B098002C0020BB3CAC74C7440020CC3EC5440020C8FCB7EC0020C6280020AC70B2C8003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "실은 내가... 이 도르비앙 묘지에서\n반지를 잃어버렸거든. 아야야...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2E4C7400020B0B4AC00002E002E002E0020C7740020B3C4B974BE44C5590020BB18C9C0C5D0C11C000ABC18C9C0B97C0020C783C5B4BC84B838AC70B4E0002E0020C544C57CC57C002E002E002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나 참, 성묘 중에 갑자기\n야생 포켓몬이 튀어나와서<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n깜짝 놀라 넘어져 버렸지 뭐니...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0980020CC38002C0020C131BB180020C911C5D00020AC11C790AE30000AC57CC0DD0020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020D280C5B4B098C640C11C00100001BE00000AAE5CC9DD0020B180B77C0020B118C5B4C8380020BC84B838C9C00020BB50B2C8002E002E002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "도시에 야생 포켓몬이 늘어나서\n묘지가 와일드 존이 되니까<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n이런 일이 생기는 거 아니야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C4C2DCC5D00020C57CC0DD0020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020B298C5B4B098C11C000ABB18C9C0AC000020C640C77CB4DC0020C874C7740020B418B2C8AE4C00100001BE00000AC774B7F00020C77CC7740020C0DDAE30B2940020AC700020C544B2C8C57C002100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 기억이 맞다면 튀어나온 건\n깜까미라는 포켓몬이었단다.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n약점이 페어리타입뿐이라는 것 같으니\n만나거든 조심하렴.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020AE30C5B5C7740020B9DEB2E4BA740020D280C5B4B098C6280020AC74000AAE5CAE4CBBF8B77CB2940020D3ECCF13BAACC774C5C8B2E8B2E4002E00100001BE01000AC57DC810C7740020D398C5B4B9ACD0C0C785BFD0C774B77CB2940020AC830020AC19C73CB2C8000AB9CCB098AC70B4E00020C870C2ECD558B834002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "반지를 잃어버린 장소는\n도르비앙 묘지 안쪽이야.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n조심히 다녀오렴.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC18C9C0B97C0020C783C5B4BC84B9B00020C7A5C18CB294000AB3C4B974BE44C5590020BB18C9C00020C548CABDC774C57C002E00100001BE00000AC870C2ECD7880020B2E4B140C624B834002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저 깜까미가\n의뢰인의 반지를 가지고 있는 것 같다...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C8000020AE5CAE4CBBF8AC00000AC758B8B0C778C7580020BC18C9C0B97C0020AC00C9C0ACE00020C788B2940020AC830020AC19B2E4002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "반지를 되찾기 위해\n싸움을 걸겠습니까?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC18C9C0B97C0020B418CC3EAE300020C704D574000AC2F8C6C0C7440020AC78ACA0C2B5B2C8AE4C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "싸운다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2F8C6B4B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "싸우지 않는다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2F8C6B0C9C00020C54AB294B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "까미~!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE4CBBF8007E002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "깜까미는\n추억의반지를 두고 사라졌다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE5CAE4CBBF8B294000ACD94C5B5C758BC18C9C0B97C0020B450ACE00020C0ACB77CC84CB2E4002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "깜까미는\n추억의반지를 가지고 있었다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE5CAE4CBBF8B294000ACD94C5B5C758BC18C9C0B97C0020AC00C9C0ACE00020C788C5C8B2E4002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "의뢰인에게 전해 주자!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C758B8B0C778C5D0AC8C0020C804D5740020C8FCC790002100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 의뢰는 어떻게 됐니?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n야생 포켓몬이 내 반지를 삼켰거나\n나쁜 짓을 한 건 아니겠지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020C758B8B0B2940020C5B4B5BBAC8C0020B410B2C8003F00100001BE01000AC57CC0DD0020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020B0B40020BC18C9C0B97C0020C0BCCF30AC70B098000AB098C05C0020C9D3C7440020D55C0020AC740020C544B2C8ACA0C9C0003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어머나, 그건 내 반지잖아!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4BA38B098002C0020ADF8AC740020B0B40020BC18C9C0C796C544002100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "추억의반지를 건넸다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD94C5B5C758BC18C9C0B97C0020AC74B138B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어머, 그러니?\n깜까미가...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4BA38002C0020ADF8B7ECB2C8003F000AAE5CAE4CBBF8AC00002E002E002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 반지를 마음에 들어 하는\n야생 포켓몬이라니, 보는 눈이 있는걸?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020BC18C9C0B97C0020B9C8C74CC5D00020B4E4C5B40020D558B294000AC57CC0DD0020D3ECCF13BAACC774B77CB2C8002C0020BCF4B2940020B208C7740020C788B294AC78003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하지만 아직 남한테 줄 순 없지.\n남편에게서 받은 결혼반지거든.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558C9C0B9CC0020C544C9C10020B0A8D55CD14C0020C9040020C21C0020C5C6C9C0002E000AB0A8D3B8C5D0AC8CC11C0020BC1BC7400020ACB0D63CBC18C9C0AC70B4E0002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고마워.\n답례로 이걸 줄게.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0B9C8C6CC002E000AB2F5B840B85C0020C774AC780020C904AC8C002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내가 죽거든 이 반지를\n묘비 위에 두라고 부탁해 둬야겠어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B4AC000020C8FDAC70B4E00020C7740020BC18C9C0B97C000ABB18BE440020C704C5D00020B450B77CACE00020BD80D0C1D5740020B46CC57CACA0C5B4002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러면 나중에\n깜까미가 가져갈지도 모르니까.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECBA740020B098C911C5D0000AAE5CAE4CBBF8AC000020AC00C838AC08C9C0B3C40020BAA8B974B2C8AE4C002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "야생 포켓몬이어도 상관없어.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n이 반지를 물려받기에\n충분한 안목을 가졌으니까 말이야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C57CC0DD0020D3ECCF13BAACC774C5B4B3C40020C0C1AD00C5C6C5B4002E00100001BE01000AC7740020BC18C9C0B97C0020BB3CB824BC1BAE30C5D0000ACDA9BD84D55C0020C548BAA9C7440020AC00C84CC73CB2C8AE4C0020B9D0C774C57C002100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 추억을 깜까미가 소중히 여겨 주면\n최고로 행복할 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020CD94C5B5C7440020AE5CAE4CBBF8AC000020C18CC911D7880020C5ECACA80020C8FCBA74000ACD5CACE0B85C0020D589BCF5D5600020AC70C57C002E00100002011401270000",
